---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Mail, Send, MessageCircle } from '@lucide/astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="联系我们 · AICookCode" description="通过 Email、X、Telegram 或 Wechat 联系 AICookCode。">
  <div class="container archive-page legal-page contact-page">
    <header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</span><h1>联系我们<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>欢迎交流 AI 应用、GitHub 实践、建站和开源项目。</p></header>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <a class="contact-card" href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}><span class="contact-card-icon"><Mail size={23} /></span><span><strong>Email</strong><small>{site.contact.email}</small></span></a>
      <a class="contact-card" href={site.contact.xUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-card-icon"><span class="contact-letter">𝕏</span></span><span><strong>X</strong><small>@aicookcode</small></span></a>
      <a class="contact-card" href={site.contact.telegramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-card-icon"><Send size={21} /></span><span><strong>Telegram</strong><small>@aicookcode</small></span></a>
      <div class="contact-card"><span class="contact-card-icon"><MessageCircle size={22} /></span><span><strong>Wechat</strong><small>{site.contact.wechatId}</small></span></div>
    </div>
    <article class="prose legal-content contact-note">
      <h2>联系说明</h2>
      <p>邮件通常适合合作、版权、内容勘误和项目交流。为了保护隐私，请不要在公开评论或邮件中发送密码、API Key、身份证件或其他不必要的敏感信息。</p>
      <p>Wechat 目前提供账号展示，添加时请备注你的来意。项目仓库确定后，本站会在页脚和开源项目页面补充 GitHub 地址。</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
